check_wiring agents/converge-reader.md '^tools: Read, Grep, Glob, Skill$' 'converge-reader declares exactly Read, Grep, Glob, Skill'
check_wiring agents/converge-reader.md 'exactly one of open, closable or drifted' 'converge-reader returns every open box as one of three verdicts'
check_wiring skills/converge/SKILL.md 'a dirty tree stops converge before the reader' 'tracked modifications stop converge before the reader'
check_wiring skills/converge/SKILL.md '--untracked-files=no'              'converge reads dirtiness off tracked files only'
check_wiring skills/converge/SKILL.md 'ask which one'                     'converge asks which change when several are in flight'
check_wiring skills/converge/SKILL.md 'source 1 only, never the queue'    'converge runs find-work source 1 and never the queue scan'
check_wiring skills/converge/SKILL.md 'find-work. defines the box'        'converge points to find-work for the box and the checklist file'
check_absent skills/converge/SKILL.md '\^\\s\*\[-\*\]\\s\+\\\[\( \|x\|X\)\\\]' 'converge does not restate the box pattern'
