check_wiring skills/converge/SKILL.md 'beside the reader.s file and line' 'converge reports a drifted box beside what the code does'
# A test name that does not exist exits 0 under `go test -run` (measured), so a named
# citation passes on its own --- PASS: line and never on an exit status.
check_wiring skills/converge/SKILL.md 'a reader.s verdict never closes a box' 'converge closes a box only on proof the session ran and read'
check_wiring skills/converge/SKILL.md 'spec-drift --anchors. before any proof' 'converge runs spec-drift --anchors before any proof'
