check_wiring skills/converge/SKILL.md 'exits 0 and prints no FAIL line'   'a file-only citation passes on exit 0 with no FAIL line'
check_wiring skills/converge/SKILL.md 'reported as .unmapped.'            'a box with no unambiguous Closes: match stays open, reported unmapped'
